<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4066" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">as-signĭfĭco</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ads-</span></b> ),
			āre, v. a.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>To show</i>, <i>make evident</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">olim tonsores non fuisse adsignificant
					antiquorum statuae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11, 10</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>To denote</i>, <i>point out</i>:
			locum, Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Gell. 10, 1</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
